 ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.730" end="00:30.560"><span begin="00:24.730" end="00:24.780">You're</span><span begin="00:24.880" end="00:25.010"> trapped</span><span begin="00:25.340" end="00:25.370"> at</span><span begin="00:25.480" end="00:25.710"> the</span><span begin="00:25.980" end="00:26.180"> bottom</span><span begin="00:26.510" end="00:26.630"> of</span><span begin="00:26.750" end="00:26.870"> your</span><span begin="00:27.050" end="00:27.310"> wishing</span><span begin="00:27.540" end="00:27.820"> well,</span><span begin="00:28.180" end="00:28.340"> buried</span><span begin="00:28.610" end="00:29.070"> underneath</span><span begin="00:29.430" end="00:29.530"> the</span><span begin="00:29.640" end="00:30.560"> wealth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.560" end="00:35.300"><span begin="00:30.560" end="00:30.740">Penny</span><span begin="00:31.000" end="00:31.160"> after</span><span begin="00:31.440" end="00:31.650"> penny,</span><span begin="00:32.030" end="00:32.520"> reaching</span><span begin="00:32.560" end="00:32.620"> for</span><span begin="00:32.930" end="00:32.960"> a</span><span begin="00:33.130" end="00:33.190"> hand</span><span begin="00:33.440" end="00:33.570"> to</span><span begin="00:33.660" end="00:33.700"> pull</span><span begin="00:33.960" end="00:34.030"> you</span><span begin="00:34.220" end="00:34.290"> out,</span><span begin="00:34.550" end="00:34.740"> and</span><span begin="00:34.890" end="00:35.390"> then</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.300" end="00:39.970"><span begin="00:35.300" end="00:35.500">You</span><span begin="00:35.650" end="00:35.880"> wake</span><span begin="00:36.080" end="00:36.170"> up</span><span begin="00:36.330" end="00:36.370"> to</span><span begin="00:36.570" end="00:36.880"> sirens</span><span begin="00:37.430" end="00:37.570"> and</span><span begin="00:37.670" end="00:37.920"> quakes</span><span begin="00:38.340" end="00:38.400"> in</span><span begin="00:38.580" end="00:38.680"> your</span><span begi